Package: fiabilitylab
Type: Package
Title: FiabilityLab: Comprehensive Reliability and Agreement Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("A.", "Chacon", email = "arquimedes.chacon@cemergy.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Chacon, A.
Maintainer: Chacon, A. <arquimedes.chacon@cemergy.com>
Description: FiabilityLab is a pedagogical jamovi module for evaluating reliability, 
    internal consistency, and inter-rater agreement. It integrates a Library and 
    Bibliography system to teach the theoretical foundations and assumptions behind 
    each statistic. Designed for academic, applied, and pedagogical use, with bilingual 
    reporting (English/Español) and interpretable diagnostic guidance.
